<title>USA: Duff/Phelps rates First American Finl unit.</title>
<headline>Duff/Phelps rates First American Finl unit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Monday it assigned an initial claims paying ability rating of Single A Minus to First American Title Insurance Co and its active title insurance subsidiaries, First American Group.</p>
<p>The company is the lead title insurance subsidiary of First American Financial Corp.</p>
<p>Duff said the rating implies high claims paying ability and is based on First American Group's strong franchise in the title insurance industry.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
